    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671240/extras/7dca97ee6a4bd1eee7697e9b5475cbb6.poster.avif?t=1747243483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671240/extras/7dca97ee6a4bd1eee7697e9b5475cbb6.webm?t=1747243483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1671240/extras/7dca97ee6a4bd1eee7697e9b5475cbb6.mp4?t=1747243483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><u>The Story</u></strong><br>Death Realm is a brand new action - adventure RPG brought to you by PEPOLA . Death Realm has a Gothic Dark Fantasy, dungeon crawling universe. Where you face tough and fearsome foes throughout your journey. Get ready to experience a Journey of Despair; of a Knight, who once was known as a force to be reckoned with, now reclaiming his power who will face the strongest elite demons from the Abyss and The Underworld who were born to destroy; The King of Flames, The Gatekeepers and Dragons of the underworld and many more!<br><br>Death Realm is a game which highly focuses on player's skills. You shall visualize and execute, Learn from your mistakes and remember that everything in this world is trying to kill you. <br><br><br><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong> <br>- Extreme Difficulty: Death Realm is challenging and unforgiving but its always going to be a fair fight. Follow the enemies' way of fighting and strategize to sabotage.<br><br>- Progression: You will be offered multiple paths to progress, it will be choice - based which means the game's consequences depends on the choices you make and the routes you take.<br><br>- Combat: Players will be able to choose between a variety of weapons ranging from swords, daggers, maces to powerful elemental magic.<br><br>**The game is still in beta and unfinished state, Please do NOT expect a complete game before buying this, We have published it on Steam as Early Access to get active feedback from players as the game develops**",
